Recordings, click maps and exports (package A3) of the Railyard product
analytics service.

- vendor/aws4fetch/: aws4fetch 1.0.20 (dist/aws4fetch.esm.mjs, its type file
  renamed to sit next to it), https://github.com/mhart/aws4fetch. MIT License,
  Copyright 2018 Michael Hart. Used to sign S3-compatible requests (AWS
  Signature Version 4) for recordings and S3 exports.
- snapshot.ts reads the recording format of rrweb (MIT,
  https://github.com/rrweb-io/rrweb) and undoes the partial compression of the
  posthog-js recorder (packages/browser/src/extensions/replay/external/
  lazy-loaded-session-recorder.ts, marker cv "2024-10"; Apache-2.0 AND MIT,
  commit 666d10918246). No code is copied; the format is re-implemented.
